1. Purpose Of The Platform

fluxo is a Mozambican fintech that provides dedicated financial technology as a
B2B SaaS platform for financial institutions in Mozambique and the SADC region.
The platform enables cooperatives, microfinance institutions, fintechs, wallets
and other financial-service providers to operate digital financial products under
their own brand.

The product scope includes, without limitation:

- digital core banking and financial product configuration;
- institutional web operations through fwallet;
- white-label customer mobile experiences through fwallet-mobile;
- fengine as the internal financial source of truth for calculations, loans,
  transactions, ledger posting, rules and audit trails;
- fpay integrations for mobile money and payment rails such as M-Pesa and e-Mola;
- fxAI services for risk scoring, credit scoring and collections prioritization;
- compliance-oriented workflows for onboarding, AML/PLD-CFT, audit trails,
  reporting and tenant isolation.

This repository contains proprietary product code, architecture, workflows,
documentation, designs, business logic, trade secrets and implementation details
of fluxo / getfluxo.io.

